    <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 1.15 }}>“为什么弱”的写法</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>示例</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, marginTop: 20, flexDirection: 'column', position: 'relative', zIndex: 5 }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 472, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1F3A34' }}>写“为什么弱”的三种写法</Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 22, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.1, background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', padding: 12 }}>一、“这句话只是结论，没给依据。”</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.1, background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', padding: 12, marginTop: 10 }}>二、“这里的例子和概念对不上，差在……”</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#1F3A34', lineHeight: 2.1, background: 'rgba(31,58,52,0.06)', padding: 12, marginTop: 10 }}>三、“这句话前后两半说的是两件事。”</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, color: '#6B6B6B', marginTop: 18 }}>写出哪一种都行，就是要具体到句子。</Text>
  </Box>
  </Box>
